content.text:
Worked example: Observe that some of the floors in the 'Building of Fun' are below the ground. What are the shops that you find on these floors? What is there on the ground floor?
{{DIAGRAM:M1.S2.T2.C2.IMG2}}
Answer: Below ground: Toys, Video Games, Cinema, Ghost House, Dinosaur (from top to bottom). Ground floor: Welcome Hall.

