content.text:
Worked example: A lift is used to go up and down between the floors. It has two buttons: '+' to go up and '−' to go down. Can you spot the lift?
{{DIAGRAM:M1.S2.T2.C3.IMG2}}
Answer: The lift is the vertical strip with buttons at the right side of the building picture.

